{"schema":"odyssey-review-notes/v1","notes":[{"datasetVersion":"2026-09-21.2","cardId":"ODY-001","number":1,"name":"The Bed Cannot Be Moved","status":"RESOLVED","entries":[{"at":"2026-09-21T10:47:29.898Z","text":"Needs a better name\nTest of the olive tree bed\nNeeds to be short and pithy","context":""}],"createdAt":"2026-09-21T10:47:29.898Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-21T11:34:24.800Z"},{"datasetVersion":"2026-09-21.2","cardId":"ODY-004","number":4,"name":"Keep the Long Watch","status":"RESOLVED","entries":[{"at":"2026-09-21T10:49:21.886Z","text":"This is the ordeal, fold them together preference this flavour, but the mechanic of the other","context":""}],"createdAt":"2026-09-21T10:49:21.886Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-21T11:34:24.934Z"},{"datasetVersion":"2026-09-21.2","cardId":"ODY-005","number":5,"name":"Athena's Intervention","status":"RESOLVED","entries":[{"at":"2026-09-21T10:50:55.440Z","text":"This can have a much better rate or do more, looking at similar cards","context":""}],"createdAt":"2026-09-21T10:50:55.440Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-21T11:34:25.016Z"},{"datasetVersion":"2026-09-21.2","cardId":"ODY-006","number":6,"name":"Row Past the Sirens","status":"RESOLVED","entries":[{"at":"2026-09-21T10:52:12.816Z","text":"This should use the strive mechanic\nI think it should untap then on the step after survive is counted","context":""}],"createdAt":"2026-09-21T10:52:12.816Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-21T11:34:25.097Z"},{"datasetVersion":"2026-09-21.2","cardId":"ODY-008","number":8,"name":"Seat the Guest by the Hearth","status":"RESOLVED","entries":[{"at":"2026-09-21T10:55:19.986Z","text":"Dosent impact the board\nToo much like previous card\nI feel like this could be pacifism with a twist\nMaybe a food token is involved\nI think we have a minor food theme, somewhere we need to make use of a couple accumulated food","context":""}],"createdAt":"2026-09-21T10:55:19.986Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-21T11:34:25.178Z"},{"datasetVersion":"2026-09-22.3","cardId":"ODY-008","number":8,"name":"Seat the Guest by the Hearth","status":"OPEN","entries":[{"at":"2026-09-21T23:51:49.688Z","text":"Or use activated abilities","context":""}],"createdAt":"2026-09-21T23:51:49.688Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-21T23:51:49.688Z"},{"datasetVersion":"2026-09-21.2","cardId":"ODY-009","number":9,"name":"Argos, Who Waited Twenty Years","status":"RESOLVED","entries":[{"at":"2026-09-21T10:56:15.623Z","text":"Argos, who waited","context":""}],"createdAt":"2026-09-21T10:56:15.623Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-21T11:34:25.259Z"},{"datasetVersion":"2026-09-21.2","cardId":"ODY-010","number":10,"name":"Telemachus Calls the Assembly","status":"RESOLVED","entries":[{"at":"2026-09-21T10:57:18.809Z","text":"Bad rate\nCouldn't find good art\nGeneric effect","context":""}],"createdAt":"2026-09-21T10:57:18.809Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-21T11:34:25.339Z"},{"datasetVersion":"2026-09-21.2","cardId":"ODY-013","number":13,"name":"Feign Madness","status":"RESOLVED","entries":[{"at":"2026-09-21T11:01:02.146Z","text":"This can have a better rate\nIt should buff toughness\nLike dive down but Ruth the draw back of losing abilities, that could also be abused","context":""}],"createdAt":"2026-09-21T11:01:02.146Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-21T11:34:25.421Z"},{"datasetVersion":"2026-09-21.2","cardId":"ODY-014","number":14,"name":"Poseidon's Storm Foretold","status":"RESOLVED","entries":[{"at":"2026-09-21T11:02:00.168Z","text":"Seems like it needs a better rate or impact","context":""}],"createdAt":"2026-09-21T11:02:00.168Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-21T11:34:25.505Z"},{"datasetVersion":"2026-09-21.2","cardId":"ODY-015","number":15,"name":"Calchas Reads the Omen","status":"RESOLVED","entries":[{"at":"2026-09-21T11:02:50.408Z","text":"Needs to be returns to hand for wu identity, not sacrifice","context":""},{"at":"2026-09-21T11:04:52.835Z","text":"Actually this just needs to be in because it has to be sacrifice","context":""}],"createdAt":"2026-09-21T11:02:50.408Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-21T11:34:25.589Z"},{"datasetVersion":"2026-09-22.3","cardId":"ODY-015","number":15,"name":"Calchas Reads the Omen","status":"OPEN","entries":[{"at":"2026-09-22T00:08:56.241Z","text":"This moment needs to centre on Iphigenia","context":""}],"createdAt":"2026-09-22T00:08:56.241Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-22T00:08:56.241Z"},{"datasetVersion":"2026-09-22.3","cardId":"ODY-017","number":17,"name":"Ordeal of the Sirens","status":"OPEN","entries":[{"at":"2026-09-22T00:10:48.889Z","text":"Our style guide should take the least wordy route that had be allowed in magic syntax, so this enchantment, for instance","context":""}],"createdAt":"2026-09-22T00:10:48.889Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-22T00:10:48.889Z"},{"datasetVersion":"2026-09-22.2","cardId":"ODY-019","number":19,"name":"Wake on Ithaca","status":"RESOLVED","entries":[{"at":"2026-09-21T19:48:36.071Z","text":"This can be called voyage's end","context":""}],"createdAt":"2026-09-21T19:48:36.071Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-21T23:45:08.730Z"},{"datasetVersion":"2026-09-22.2","cardId":"ODY-020","number":20,"name":"Tell the Cyclops Your Name","status":"RESOLVED","entries":[{"at":"2026-09-21T19:48:55.127Z","text":"Reprint of the card Hubris","context":""}],"createdAt":"2026-09-21T19:48:55.127Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-21T23:45:08.853Z"},{"datasetVersion":"2026-09-22.3","cardId":"ODY-020","number":20,"name":"Tell the Cyclops Your Name","status":"OPEN","entries":[{"at":"2026-09-22T00:12:24.006Z","text":"Just to straight reprint here","context":""}],"createdAt":"2026-09-22T00:12:24.006Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-22T00:12:24.006Z"},{"datasetVersion":"2026-09-22.2","cardId":"ODY-021","number":21,"name":"Fell Timbers for the Raft","status":"RESOLVED","entries":[{"at":"2026-09-21T19:50:42.642Z","text":"Name: Cut the raft timbers","context":""}],"createdAt":"2026-09-21T19:50:42.642Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-21T23:45:08.966Z"},{"datasetVersion":"2026-09-22.2","cardId":"ODY-022","number":22,"name":"Keeper of Funeral Fires","status":"RESOLVED","entries":[{"at":"2026-09-21T19:52:37.966Z","text":"Wherever another creature dies, you may pay {\n1}. If you do, mill a card.","context":""}],"createdAt":"2026-09-21T19:52:37.966Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-21T23:45:09.075Z"},{"datasetVersion":"2026-09-22.2","cardId":"ODY-023","number":23,"name":"Bolt the Courtyard Doors","status":"RESOLVED","entries":[{"at":"2026-09-21T19:55:07.665Z","text":"Bolt the doors\nNeeds to feel like we're getting ready for a big, successful attack with the effects being too splashy","context":""}],"createdAt":"2026-09-21T19:55:07.665Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-21T23:45:09.194Z"},{"datasetVersion":"2026-09-22.3","cardId":"ODY-023","number":23,"name":"Bolt the Doors","status":"OPEN","entries":[{"at":"2026-09-22T00:13:30.400Z","text":"I think this is \"creatures you control\"","context":""}],"createdAt":"2026-09-22T00:13:30.400Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-22T00:13:30.400Z"},{"datasetVersion":"2026-09-22.2","cardId":"ODY-024","number":24,"name":"Trace the Omen","status":"RESOLVED","entries":[{"at":"2026-09-21T19:56:21.372Z","text":"If you don't own a card in exile, exile a card from your hand.","context":""}],"createdAt":"2026-09-21T19:56:21.372Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-21T23:45:09.310Z"},{"datasetVersion":"2026-09-22.2","cardId":"ODY-029","number":29,"name":"Betray the Hidden Armory","status":"RESOLVED","entries":[{"at":"2026-09-21T20:00:07.891Z","text":"I would need artwork for an armory\nThis seems weak for the rate","context":""}],"createdAt":"2026-09-21T20:00:07.891Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-21T23:45:09.419Z"},{"datasetVersion":"2026-09-22.2","cardId":"ODY-030","number":30,"name":"First Arrow at the Feast","status":"RESOLVED","entries":[{"at":"2026-09-21T20:01:13.040Z","text":"Name: Neck shot","context":""}],"createdAt":"2026-09-21T20:01:13.040Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-21T23:45:09.537Z"},{"datasetVersion":"2026-09-22.2","cardId":"ODY-033","number":33,"name":"Row Through the Gale","status":"RESOLVED","entries":[{"at":"2026-09-21T20:11:04.359Z","text":"I'm not a fan of inventing journey counters just for this. Either use an existing counter type, probably quest, or come up with a more interesting design for this cycle","context":""}],"createdAt":"2026-09-21T20:11:04.359Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-21T23:45:09.653Z"},{"datasetVersion":"2026-09-22.2","cardId":"ODY-036","number":36,"name":"Eurycleia's Basin","status":"RESOLVED","entries":[{"at":"2026-09-21T20:14:14.967Z","text":"Artwork for this would be best as an actual antique or ancient basin that could be used for foot washing","context":""}],"createdAt":"2026-09-21T20:14:14.967Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-21T23:45:09.772Z"},{"datasetVersion":"2026-09-22.3","cardId":"ODY-036","number":36,"name":"Eurycleia's Basin","status":"OPEN","entries":[{"at":"2026-09-22T00:18:09.746Z","text":"I either want to add in support for this or make sure the payoff matches stuff we're really supporting. Maybe this should link into turns face up?","context":""}],"createdAt":"2026-09-22T00:18:09.746Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-22T00:18:09.746Z"},{"datasetVersion":"2026-09-22.2","cardId":"ODY-037","number":37,"name":"Treacherous Maidservant","status":"RESOLVED","entries":[{"at":"2026-09-21T20:16:03.630Z","text":"The flavour here is that they are made to clean up the dead suitors","context":""}],"createdAt":"2026-09-21T20:16:03.630Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-21T23:45:09.881Z"},{"datasetVersion":"2026-09-22.3","cardId":"ODY-037","number":37,"name":"Treacherous Maidservant","status":"OPEN","entries":[{"at":"2026-09-22T00:20:18.563Z","text":"This should be maidservants, and should suggest the group, they clean up a whole slaughter worth of bodies and they're are six of them, can be a higher mana, not great rate for body","context":""}],"createdAt":"2026-09-22T00:20:18.563Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-22T00:20:18.563Z"},{"datasetVersion":"2026-09-22.2","cardId":"ODY-038","number":38,"name":"Forge-Sparks","status":"RESOLVED","entries":[{"at":"2026-09-21T20:17:43.229Z","text":"Doesn't really tie into set mechanical theme, weak in flavour too","context":""}],"createdAt":"2026-09-21T20:17:43.229Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-21T23:45:09.996Z"},{"datasetVersion":"2026-09-22.2","cardId":"ODY-039","number":39,"name":"Blood on the Walls","status":"RESOLVED","entries":[{"at":"2026-09-21T20:20:51.682Z","text":"Flavour here is predicting death\nThis can be like an edict but you get something additional conditionally","context":""}],"createdAt":"2026-09-21T20:20:51.682Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-21T23:45:10.110Z"},{"datasetVersion":"2026-09-22.2","cardId":"ODY-040","number":40,"name":"Shipwright's Adze","status":"RESOLVED","entries":[{"at":"2026-09-21T20:21:16.953Z","text":"Can you find me this object for the artwork?","context":""}],"createdAt":"2026-09-21T20:21:16.953Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-21T23:45:10.217Z"},{"datasetVersion":"2026-09-22.2","cardId":"ODY-041","number":41,"name":"Test the Swineherd","status":"RESOLVED","entries":[{"at":"2026-09-21T20:23:40.407Z","text":"Test should be a format of card that can be expressed differently for each colour","context":""}],"createdAt":"2026-09-21T20:23:40.407Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-21T23:45:10.323Z"},{"datasetVersion":"2026-09-22.2","cardId":"ODY-042","number":42,"name":"Find the Next Shore","status":"RESOLVED","entries":[{"at":"2026-09-21T20:25:18.688Z","text":"Same note on journey as before","context":""}],"createdAt":"2026-09-21T20:25:18.688Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-21T23:45:10.434Z"},{"datasetVersion":"2026-09-22.2","cardId":"ODY-043","number":43,"name":"Remember the Refrain","status":"RESOLVED","entries":[{"at":"2026-09-21T20:29:42.835Z","text":"This should use constellation\nRecall the refrain is better name","context":""}],"createdAt":"2026-09-21T20:29:42.835Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-21T23:45:10.544Z"},{"datasetVersion":"2026-09-22.2","cardId":"ODY-044","number":44,"name":"Pull Together at the Oars","status":"RESOLVED","entries":[{"at":"2026-09-21T20:31:23.721Z","text":"Row in unison","context":""}],"createdAt":"2026-09-21T20:31:23.721Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-21T23:45:10.661Z"},{"datasetVersion":"2026-09-22.2","cardId":"ODY-045","number":45,"name":"Sudden Squall","status":"RESOLVED","entries":[{"at":"2026-09-21T20:32:43.724Z","text":"This should be the bad rate big red removal spell for limited","context":""}],"createdAt":"2026-09-21T20:32:43.724Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-21T23:45:10.773Z"},{"datasetVersion":"2026-09-22.2","cardId":"ODY-046","number":46,"name":"Test the Goatherd","status":"RESOLVED","entries":[{"at":"2026-09-21T20:33:38.349Z","text":"This should follow the test series","context":""}],"createdAt":"2026-09-21T20:33:38.349Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-21T23:45:10.883Z"}]}